15885.9s 459 We do not claim that ASPP, spatial-attention ROI gating, label-graph attention, or reconstruction-based regularization are individually novel — each is adapted from a specific prior CXR study. The contribution is their scientifically motivated integration into a single architecture, evaluated under patient-level cross-validation with calibration, uncertainty estimation, bounding-box-grounded explainability, corruption robustness, and statistical significance testing on NIH ChestX-ray14 — an evaluation rigor not jointly present in any single paper of the reviewed corpus.
